I'm slowly proceeding with my "The Manga Guide to Lojban" (similar, in
spirit, to "The Manga Guide to ..." series: http://goo.gl/W4lGp ).

After 8 pages ( http://lojbockule.thecomicseries.com/comics/1/ ) I've
not named any character yet!

The problem is that I can't decide which name is better. I've given
some provisional name but I would really need some input.

I would love to give Japanese names but I would also like to give
names with a meaning so that when translated in lojban we could use
that meaning.

I've prepared a very short description of each character:
https://dl.dropbox.com/u/7681579/chars.pdf any suggestion on names (or
on anything else) will be very appreciated.

Thanks,
